Carousel: the arrows beside the heading and below the carousel, and the "More" button, are now the site's buttons: the arrows are squares as tall as the "More" button, and both take the picked button colour with its hover (an outline fills with its colour). The "More" button's text now turns to the colour's text colour on hover; before, its own rules kept the outline colour. "Standard" fills with the text colour on hover. The "More" button is now the same size as other buttons (it was smaller and faded). Gallery: a picked arrow colour now has the buttons' hover too.
